      "description": "Once per battle round, one model in this unit can use a signum. When it does, until the end of the phase, one friendly ADEPTUS ASTARTES INFANTRY unit within 6\" of this unit has the LETHAL HITS ability on its ranged attacks.",
      "type": "unit",
      "timing": "shooting phase"
    }
